{
  "name": "metaontic-video",
  "version": "3.13.3",
  "description": "AI video creation plugin for DeepSeek Harness: Seedance 2.0 long videos with multi-segment continuation, text-to-video, image-to-video, script and storyboard review, segment previews, resumable generation and local FFmpeg merging.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "keywords": [
    "metaontic-video",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "deepseek-harness-plugin",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ai-video",
    "ai-video-generation",
    "seedance",
    "seedance-2",
    "long-video",
    "video-generation",
    "text-to-video",
    "image-to-video",
    "video-continuation",
    "video-extension",
    "storyboard",
    "ffmpeg",
    "new-api",
    "video-director"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video/issues"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "skills",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "logo.svg",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "MetaOnticVideo使用说明书.md",
    "MetaOnticVideo使用说明书.pdf",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs/guide/*.svg",
    "docs/guide/*.png",
    "THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-tool",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-session",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-plugin-manager",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes"
      ]
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.19.43",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "react": "^19.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^19.3.1",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3",
    "hyperframes": "0.8.223",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "~3.18.5"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "build:locale": "node scripts/build.mjs locale",
    "build:host": "node scripts/build.mjs host",
    "build:client": "node scripts/build.mjs client",
    "build": "npm run typecheck && node scripts/build.mjs",
    "preview": "node scripts/preview.mjs",
    "release": "node scripts/release.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "releaseNotes": {
    "version": "3.13.3",
    "prerelease": false,
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T07:20:12.845Z",
    "items": [
      "新增：一键发布脚本，运行 npm run release -- X.Y.Z 即可完成整轮发布；也可双击 Windows 的 release.cmd 或 Mac 的 release.command 按提示输入版本号。",
      "优化：一键发布会先显示待发布范围与更新说明，再更新版本号与锁文件、同步 README 与 CHANGELOG 及包内更新说明，然后构建、测试、打包、提交、打附注标签、推送双仓、等待双平台安装检查与附件上传，最后输出发布页、tgz 安装地址和 Windows ZIP 下载地址。",
      "新增：一键发布支持 --dry-run 只检查计划，不写文件、不改版本、不提交、不联网；支持 --resume 在同一版本下续跑未完成的发布，不覆盖已有标签。",
      "优化：构建改用跨平台脚本 scripts/build.mjs，去掉此前依赖命令替换的写法，Windows 与 macOS 都能直接构建插件、客户端与语言文件。",
      "优化：Windows 安装资料包内的图文教程重写为六步操作（解压 ZIP → 找到 .tgz → 复制完整路径 → 粘贴到「添加插件」→ 填 Key 保存 → 开始创作），并给出安装成功的判断标志与可折叠的常见问题；网页版与文本版内容一致。",
      "优化：使用说明书补充 Windows 本地安装要点，明确新安装填写 .tgz 文件路径、package 目录只用于查看资料或恢复旧安装，从界面粘贴路径时需删除两端的英文双引号。",
      "修复：Windows 安装资料包内的「先读我」文本改用 CRLF 行尾，用记事本打开不再整段挤在一行。"
    ]
  }
}
